
Product Vision 
Nowadays , students struggle with efficiently managing their daily schedules and the fact that most Universities still use a manual appointment booking system isn't helping at all. Students have to physically visit the clinic each time to be able to schedule an appointment which is not a fast or easy process as it leads to multiple students overcrowding the place. This causes long waiting time and inefficient schedule management for both students and clinic staff.


Target Users: 
The target user for the Clinic appointment systems is university students who need to manage their healthcare by booking medical appointments at their campus clinic. Additionally, clinic staff so they can be able to manage the appointments by keeping everything up to date and monitor their daily schedule.
Lastly, system administrators to be able to manage user access , roles and information.
 

Proposed Solution:
Our solution is to create a digital clinic appointment booking system that compliments user needs. For instance the system will allow students to view all the available appointment slots from their place and book based on what fits their busy schedules.
In addition both clinic staff and admin can view and manage easily through the system 


Value of the System:
Our system will help address  the struggles of students, clinic staff, and admins. As students will be able to easily schedule appointments without physically visiting the clinic and causing a crowded area hence also helping clinic staff from that aspect. This will reduce waiting time and also improve the management of students  for the clinic staff and management of users to the administrators. At the end of the day the system will lead to an organized easy approach.
 

Contribution to Sustainable Development Goal 
As the system is improving healthcare services within the university it directly supports SDG 3 Good Health and Well Being. In conclusion changing the whole appointments process into a digital system ensures students receive medical care easily and efficiently.




